{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在扫读效率上不如Y，尤其S01、S06感受短语较密，观众容易被大量细节分散注意力；Y的左右分区更容易快速找到叙事主线。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然更密，但关键词放大加亮，能让观众迅速抓住每段真正发生的心理变化；感受又能随着音乐分段出现，使情绪转折与音乐进程互相印证。尤其在怀念、委屈、孤独、渴望亲近和重新站稳之间，X保留了更多具体的心理层次，前后也形成了清楚的变化：他不是不再想念，而是不再为了想念牺牲自己。Y的叙事更顺、更容易扫读，但部分感受被概括化，人物内心的矛盾和音乐情绪的细腻变化没有X那么充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e3d20b66-93cb-42a9-9c78-b947b8ee5fca", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T205704808145Z", "elapsed_seconds": 88.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T20:58:33.427240+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b6dbdb94184f8e507951566269ecb97b924ef3673a7f00f3cbbadb13cd546a39", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\c